@startuml
package "Client Side" {
  [Mobile App (iOS/Android)] as Mobile
  [Desktop Web App] as Web
}

package "Cloud Infrastructure (DevTalk)" {
  [API Gateway] as Gateway
  [Auth Service] as Auth
  [Chat & WebSocket Service] as Chat
  [DevHub Webhook Listener] as DevHub
  
  database "PostgreSQL (Users & Chats)" as DB
  database "Redis (Message Cache)" as Cache
}

cloud "External Services" {
  [GitHub / GitLab] as Git
  [Firebase/APNs (Push)] as Push
}

Mobile <--> Gateway : REST / WSS
Web <--> Gateway : REST / WSS

Gateway --> Auth : Token Verify
Gateway --> Chat : Route Messages
Gateway --> DevHub : Manage Integrations

Chat <--> Cache : Fast Access
Chat --> DB : Persist Messages
Chat --> Push : Trigger Notifications

Git --> DevHub : Webhooks (Push, PR)
DevHub --> Chat : Generate Commit Card
@enduml